Discover the BTN Sports app, your reliable guide to the dynamic world of sport. Keep up to date with everything from great rivalries to decisive battles against relegation, with the latest results, goals and match details at your fingertips.
Follow the main sporting events around the world with our BTN Sports app. In our app, you can easily find the main news about soccer, hockey, basketball, tennis, volleyball. Whether you're on the stadium or in the stands, on or off the pitch, BTN Sports will keep you up to date.
Here you'll find detailed statistics on over 200 tournaments, including:
Soccer. World Cup, APL, Champions League, Serie A, Bundesliga, MLS, Europa League, Ligue 1, Italian Cup, Spanish Cup, La Liga, UEFA Super Cup, RPL and many more;
Basketball. NBA, World Cup, European Basketball Championship, National University Sports Association, Euroleague and other leagues;
Hockey. KHL, NHL, German Hockey League, Swedish Hockey League, Extraliga, Major Hockey League;
Tennis. Australian Open, Roland-Garros, Wimbledon Championships;
and many other sports.

BTN Sports contains all the information you need on sports today: news and articles from your favorite authors and authorities in the world of sports, rankings, information on past and future matches. You no longer have to constantly search for information on the Internet. Everything that matters is now in your hands.
